# Native projects are generated by `expo prebuild` (CNG) and never committed.
# Listed here, not only in the repo-root .gitignore: on EAS build workers the
# fingerprint runs without git and only reads .gitignore files inside this
# folder. Without these lines a generated android/ or ios/ folder changes the
# runtime version there, so it no longer matches the one computed locally.
/android
/ios
